- Generic README file covering both VHDL and Verilog release variants.

ARM7TDMI AHB Wrapper
===================

This directory contains the files for the ARM7TDMI AHB wrapper.

The compilation order is:

ClockNand.v(hd)     (in global_ADK/verilog or global_ADK/vhdl)
ClockInv.v(hd)      (in global_ADK/verilog or global_ADK/vhdl)
LATS.v(hd)          (in global_ADK/verilog or global_ADK/vhdl)
A7TWrapCtrl.v(hd)
A7TWrapTest.v(hd)
A7WrapMaster.v(hd)
A7WrapSM.v(hd)
A7TWrap.v(hd)
A7TDMI.v(hd)

The ARM7TDMIr3.ss.tdef and ARM7TDMIr3.ff.tdef files are 66MHz C timing
shell files for use with an ARM7TDMI ModelGen simulation model.

These will require conversion to sdf timing files if an sdf simulation
model is used.
